<title>JAPAN: Asahimatsu - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Asahimatsu - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.93		vs	    7.05</p>
<p> Operating	  125    million    vs	  242    million</p>
<p> Current	    163    million    vs	  273    million</p>
<p> Net		   86    million    vs	  146    million</p>
<p> EPS		    9.22 yen	  vs	   15.66 yen</p>
<p> Shares		9 million	  vs	   9 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Asahimatsu Foods Co Ltd is a food maker focusing on freeze-dried tofu.</p>
